<title>NETHERLANDS: TENNIS-WORLD INDOOR TOURNAMENT FOURTH DAY RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WORLD INDOOR TOURNAMENT FOURTH DAY RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the fourth day of</p>
<p>the $750,000 men's Rotterdam World Indoor tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Thursday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>Martin Sinner (Germany) beat Alex Radulescu (Germany) 3-6 7-6</p>
<p>(7-2) 6-4</p>
<p>Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic) beat Dennis Van Scheppingen</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 7-6 (7-5) 4-6 6-1</p>
<p>Michael Stich (Germany) beat Tomas Carbonell (Spain) 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>1-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Guillaume Raoux (France) 7-5</p>
<p>6-7 (5-7) 6-3</p>
</text>
